section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/birth/corrupted.lua"

t("Doombringer", "ドゥームブリンガー", "birth descriptor name")
t("Weapon in hand and sheathed in flame, a Doombringer is a terrifying force in combat.", "　武器を手に、炎を纏う恐るべき戦士です。", "_t")
t("Doombringers are engines of war, cleaving and burning their way through entire armies.", "　一騎当千の強者で、敵陣を切り払い、焼き尽くします。", "_t")
t("The most powerful Doombringers can harness the full power of their demonic ties and transform themselves into a gigantic demon.", "　トップクラスの者ともなればデーモンの力を完全に制御し魔神に変身できます。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength and Magic", "　腕力と魔力が重要です。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +2 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋４　耐久＋２　魔力＋２", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 Magic, +0 Willpower, +1 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *賢さ＋１", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +3", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#＋３", "_t")
t("Demonologist", "デモノロジスト", "birth descriptor name")
t("Most simply run, but I understand: a distant planet, ravaged and damned. Burnt creations seek righteous vengeance, Urh'Rok's ashes, now destruction's engines. Harness their power! Capture and tame! I call on you, demons - UNLEASH THE FLAMES!", "諸人がただ逃げ惑う中、我は悟る。空の彼方に荒れ果てた不吉の星。煉獄の住人たちは正義の裁きを叫び、アーロックの許しを請う彼らは殺戮に全てを捧げた。その力を制御しろ！　手中に収め、飼いならすのだ！　出でよ、デーモン！　全てを焼き尽くせ！", "_t")
t("Contrary to popular beliefs Demonologists are not the pawns of demons, they enact pacts with them but always very carefully.", "　一般的なイメージと異なり、デモノロジストはデーモンの尖兵ではありません。デーモンと手は組みますが、大抵は熟慮の上のことです。", "_t")
t("They use those demonic powers for their own purpose, often evil but a few have been known to use demonic powers to fight demons.", "　彼らは自らの目的のため、デーモンの力を利用します。悪事を働く者がほとんどですが、その力をデーモンとの戦いに向ける者も稀にいるようです。", "_t")
t("Demonologists are melee fighters, bashing their foes skulls with their shields while calling down rains of fire and darkness.", "　デモノロジストは近接系のクラスです。盾で敵の頭蓋を粉砕し、周囲には炎と暗黒が降り注ぎます。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +2 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋３　耐久＋２", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 Magic, +0 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋４", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +2", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#＋２", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/birth/doomelf.lua"

t("Doomelf", "ドゥームエルフ", "birth descriptor name")
t([[The demons of Mal'Rok would never bless you!
Three could tell them of the horrors elves wrought.
One rages and torments in deep oceans blue,
one fights for the third with the cultists she taught.
Silence these beings, maintain your deception,
and then you may witness a new elf's conception...]], "　マル・ロックのデーモンはエルフを永久に呪う！　３人のデーモンがエルフの引き起こした惨事を語るだろう。１人目は蒼海の奥底で怒りに悶える。２人目は３人目のため、彼女の手懐けた信徒と共に戦っている。これら３名の口を封じ、素知らぬ顔を続けるがいい。そうすれば新たなエルフの姿を目にすることだろう・・・", "_t")
t("Doomelves are not a real race, they are Shaloren that have been taken by demons and transformed into harbingers of doom.", "　ドゥームエルフは正確には種族ではありません。デーモンがシャローレを捕え、尖兵として改造したのです。", "_t")
t("They enjoy unleashing torments and suffering on their victims.", "　ドゥームエルフは獲物を痛めつけ、悶え苦しむ様を堪能します。", "_t")
t("They possess the #GOLD#Haste of the Doomed#WHITE# talent which allows them to phase away once in a while.", "　#GOLD#「デモニックシフト」#WHITE#の能力で転移を繰り返します。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * -2 Strength, +1 Dexterity, +1 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力－２　機敏＋１　耐久＋１", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 Magic, +2 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋３　意志＋２", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# 9", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#９", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Experience penalty:#LIGHT_BLUE# 12%", "#GOLD#経験修正：#LIGHT_BLUE#１２％", "_t")

