section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua"

t("Blackfire Aegis", "★黒炎の守護", "entity name")
t("blackened stone shield", "黒ずんだ石の盾", "_t")
t("This rugged stone shield flickers with bursts of pitch black flame.", "でこぼことした石の盾だ。漆黒の炎が迸り、輝いている。", "_t")
t("releases a burst of dark fire, dealing damage equal to your magic stat", "暗黒炎の爆発が起こる。ダメージは自身の魔力に等しい。", "_t")
t("Will of Ul'Gruth", "★ウル・グルスの潰腕", "entity name")
t("massive metallic gauntlets", "金属製巨大ガントレット", "_t")
t("These massive gauntlets once belonged to a very powerful demon named Ul'Gruth. The behemoth was said to be able to level entire buildings with a single swing of his hands.", "ウル・グルスという名の強大なデーモンが所持していた巨大なガントレットだ。かの大デーモンは両腕を一振りするだけで居並ぶ建物を更地にできたという。", "_t")
t("Your Obliterating Smash can destroy walls.", "ルインスマッシュで壁が壊れる。", "_t")
t("Fearfire Mantle", "★魔界炎布", "entity name")
t("cloak shaped flames", "マントの形をした炎", "_t")
t("Black fires born of a blackened heart.", "黒き炎は黒き心臓より出ずる。", "_t")
t("All enemies in radius 2 take 20 fire damage each turn and healing you for 10% of the damage dealt.", "近場の敵全員に毎ターン火炎属性の２０ダメージを与える。これで与えたダメージの１０％分自身のＨＰを回復。", "_t")
t("Plague-Fire Sceptre", "★濁炎のセプター", "entity name")
t("darkness infused staff", "闇を封じた杖", "_t")
t("The flames of Mal'Rok can be more stubborn than most. When they run out of fuel they have been known go out of their way to find more.", "マル・ロックの炎ほど手に負えぬものはあるまい。対象を燃やし尽くせば次なる獲物を求めるという。", "_t")
t("Plaguefire detonates when its victim dies, spreading to other enemies up to two times.", "穢れし炎の対象が死亡した場合、周囲の敵に延焼する。ただし２回まで。", "_t")
t("fire a bolt of plaguefire, dealing damage over time based on your magic stat", "穢れし炎を放ち３ターンかけてダメージを与える。ダメージは魔力に依存する。", "_t")
t("Dethblyd", "★ですぶれいど", "entity name")
t("pitch black sword", "漆黒の剣", "_t")
t("Grushgore the Destroyer was as famous for his incredible brutality as he was for his childlike intelligence. He wasn't known for his subtlety of naming, but there's no denying the power of his massive sword.", "破壊者グルシュゴアの残忍さは広く知れ渡っており、幼児の如きその知能もまた同様であった。ネーミングセンスの方はお察しだが、かのデーモンの大剣が強大な力を秘めていることは確かだ。", "_t")
t("Increases all damage dealt, and reduces all damage taken, by 1%, stacking up to 10 times. Resets after 10 turns without attacking.", "与ダメージ１％増加。被ダメージ１％減少。それぞれ最大で１０回累積可能。１０ターン攻撃しないとこの効果はリセットされる。", "_t")
t("Quasit's Skull", "★クアシトヘッド", "entity name")
t("rocky helm", "固い兜", "_t")
t("Some enterprising adventurer seems to have noticed the skin of quasits is actually tougher than most metals, and fashioned this helm from one. Shame about the smell.", "「実のところ、クアシトの皮膚はどんな鋼にも引けを取らない」と気付いた冒険者が実際にそれで兜を作ったようだ。臭いがキツイのが玉に瑕。", "_t")
t("Revenant", "★幽鬼の鎧", "entity name")
t("shifting breastplate", "歪曲ブレストプレート", "_t")
t("The joints of this armor creak ominously, the frame bends and heaves, almost as if breathing. The scratch and crack of metal mutters of suffering, of loss, perseverance and revenge.", "関節部が不気味に軋みを上げ、炎がまるで息をするかのように纏わりついている。表面についた傷とヒビからは苦痛と死、忍耐と復讐の念が伝わってくる。", "_t")
t("Status resistances shift over time to match the statuses you are being hit by.", "現在受けているステータス異常に応じて、対応する耐性が変化していく。", "_t")
t("Imp Claw", "★インプの爪", "entity name")
t("red, mottled claw", "赤斑点の爪", "_t")
t("The battered remains of a flame imp's hand. It still burns with that unnatural flame.", "フレイムインプの手を平らに叩き潰したものだ。未だにこの世の物ならざる炎で燃え盛っている。", "_t")
t("Wheel of Fate", "★運命の車輪", "entity name")
t([["This isn't what I wished for!" - Howar Muransk, Cornac demonologist.

This band of gothic obsidian menaces with an embossed image of a grinning skull. It beckons you to tempt fate and put it on. Do you?]], [[「コレじゃねえよ！」－ホワー・ムランスク（コーナックのデモノロジスト）
　古めかしい黒曜石の指輪だ。ニヤリと笑いを浮かべた髑髏が彫り込んであり、不気味な感じがする。運命に立ち向かうべく、指に嵌めるように囁きかけてくるが・・・さて？]], "_t")
t("strange black ring", "黒い奇妙な指輪", "_t")
t("#RED#The ring refuses to be removed!", "#RED#指輪が外れない！", "logPlayer")
t("Cannot be unequipped or rerolled until level %d.", "レベル %d になるまで外せないし、再生成できない。", "tformat")
t("Can be unequipped, can't be rerolled.", "外せるが、再生成できない。", "_t")
t("Can be unequipped or rerolled.", "外したり、再生成できる。", "_t")
t("re-generate the item with random stats. Can only be done three levels after the last reroll. Cannot be unequipped unless a reroll is available, or you are level 50", "アイテムを再生成する。再生成してから３レベル上がる度に再生成する権利を得る。再生成できないときは外すことができない。レベル５０になればいつでも外せる。", "_t")
t("#RED#The ring does not react.", "#RED#指輪は反応しない", "logPlayer")
t("#CRIMSON#Your timetravel has no effect on pre-determined outcomes such as this.", "#CRIMSON#この種の既に決定された事柄はタイムトラベルでは変えられない。", "_t")
t("Wheel of Fate", "★運命の車輪", "_t")
t("#GREEN#The skull embossed in the ring twists around momentarily. ...Did it just laugh?", "#GREEN#指輪の髑髏が一瞬、ぐにゃぐにゃと歪んだ。・・・今、笑ったのか？", "logPlayer")
t("Helm of the Dominated", "★コントロールヘルム", "entity name")
t("horned helm", "角付き兜", "_t")
t("An experimental helmet designed to enhance the effects of the Doomelf corruption.", "ドゥームエルフの邪なる力を増幅するために試作された兜だ。", "_t")
t("Increases the range of Haste of the Doomed by 1.", "デモニックシフトの射程が１増加。", "_t")
t("The Black Crown", "★ブラッククラウン", "entity name")
t("cracked obsidian crown", "壊れた黒曜石の宝冠", "_t")
t("\"For the demon who has everything.\"", "「全てを総べたもうデーモンに」", "_t")
t("Increases all saves by your Shadow Power.", "シャドウパワー１につき全てのセーブ上昇。", "_t")
t("The Black Core", "★ブラックコア", "entity name")
t("pitch black gemstone", "黒の宝珠", "_t")
t("\"Lock your soul away, and death will never reach you.\"", "「魂を隔離せよ。さすれば永久の命を得ん」", "_t")
t("Grants spellpower equal to your Shadow Power.", "シャドウパワーに等しい魔法パワー増加。", "_t")
t("The Black Spike", "★ブラックスパイク", "entity name")
t("thin black sword", "黒の細身の剣", "_t")
t("\"All the better to pierce the heart of the world.\"", "「これぞ世界の中心を貫くに相応しい」", "_t")
t("Increases all damage penetration by 1% for each point of your Shadow Power.", "全ダメージ貫通をシャドウパワー１につき１％上昇させる。", "_t")
t("The Black Boots", "★ブラックブーツ", "entity name")
t("pair of pitch black boots", "黒のブーツ", "_t")
t("\"It's a treacherous road to the top of the world.\"", "「世界の頂点に至るは危うき道」", "_t")
t("Grants 2.5% movement speed for each point of Shadow Power.", "シャドウパワー１につき移動速度が２．５％増加", "_t")
t("The Black Ring", "★ブラックリング", "entity name")
t("obsidian ring", "黒曜石の指輪", "_t")
t("\"An innocuous bauble. Until you look through the hole.\"", "「何の変哲もない指輪だ。穴の部分を覗き込まなければの話だが」", "_t")
t("Grants spell-crit equal to half of your Shadow Power.", "シャドウパワーの半分だけ魔法クリティカル率増加。", "_t")
t("The Black Plate", "★ブラックアーマー", "entity name")
t("pitch black breastplate", "黒のブレストプレート", "_t")
